:: Spa
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>>
<<if !$daily.spaEvent>>
	<<spa_event_select>>
<</if>>

<<switch Time.season>>
	<<case "summer">>
		<<set _price to 1000>>
	<<case "winter">>
		<<set _price to 6000>>
	<<default>>
		<<set _price to 2500>>
<</switch>>

You are in the spa on Danube Street. Large windows open onto a natural spring, and a corridor to the side leads to other facilities.
A sign reads: "Tanning beds available. <<printmoney _price>> per session. Price may change with the season."
<br><br>
<<if Time.openingHours()>>
	<<if $daily.spaEvent is "party">>
		<span class="purple">The spring is packed with bodies, and loud music plays.</span> Someone's hired the venue for a party.
	<<else>>
		Patrons relax in and around the many pools.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You can hear running water, but the establishment is otherwise quiet.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>

	<<passoutshop "spa">>
<<else>>
	<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
		<<orgasmLocation "spa">>
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.hour is $closinghour>>
		It's closing time. The receptionist is herding everyone outside.<<if $exposed gte 1>> Panic swells within you as you realise how exposed you'll be should you be found in this state of dress.<</if>>
		<br>
	<<elseif !Time.openingHours()>>
		You are alone in the darkness.
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
		<<if $uncomfortable.nude is false>>
		You hide in a cupboard. The thought of being caught is thrilling, but you decide it would be wiser to stay put.
		<<else>>
		You hide in a cupboard to protect your dignity.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.openingHours() and $exposed lt 1>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		<<if $spa_job gte 1>>
			<<spaicon "massage">><<link [[Work as a masseur (<<printmoney 1000>> 0:50)|Spa Work Start]]>><<endevent>><<money 1000 "spa">><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			The receptionist, a <<person>>, looks up from <<his>> desk, and curls <<his>> nose. "Make it quick," <<he>> says. "Our clientele don't mix with riff-raff off the street."
			<br><br>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for work|Spa Work Ask]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $money gte _price>>
			<<set _tanning to Skin.getTanningFactor(true)>>
			<<spaicon "tanning">><<link [[Tanning salon (<<printmoney _price>> 1:00)|Spa Tan]]>><<money `-_price` "spa">><</link>><<lstress>><<tanningGainOutput _tanning.result 60>>
		<<else>>
			<<spaicon "tanning">><span class="blue">You cannot afford to use the tanning salon right now.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if !Time.openingHours() and Time.hour isnot $closinghour and !$weekly.theft.spa>>
		<<shopicon "register">><<link [[Examine the cash register|Spa Register]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<danubeicon>><<link [[Leave|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Spa Tan
<<effects>>

<<person1>><<person>>【은는】 킁킁거리지만, 불평 없이 당신의 돈을 받는다.
<<endevent>>
<br><br>
태닝 베드가 놓인 작은 방으로 들어간다. 큰 창문이 있지만, 이미 커튼으로 가려져 있다.
<br><br>

<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">>
	<<link [[속옷만 남기고 벗는다 (1:00)|Spa Tan Underwear]]>><<stress -6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[알몸으로 벗는다 (1:00)|Spa Tan Naked]]>><<stress -6>><</link>><<exhibitionist1>>
<br>
<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
	<<link [[알몸으로 벗고 커튼을 연다 (1:00)|Spa Tan Curtains]]>><<stress -6>><</link>><<exhibitionist5>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Spa Tan Underwear
<<effects>>

<<upperstrip>>
<<lowerstrip>>
<<legsstrip>>
<<feetstrip>>
<<handsstrip>>
<<handheldstrip>>
<<neckstrip>>
<<headstrip>>
<<set Skin.tanningBonus = 2>>
<<set Skin.tanningBed to true>>

옷을 깔끔하게 개어두고 태닝 베드에 올라가 뚜껑을 닫는다.
<br><br>

푸른빛에 둘러싸여, 따스함이 피부에 스며들자 눈을 감고 긴장을 푼다.
<br>
<<set _tanningModifiers to Skin.getTanningFactor(true)>>
<<tanningPenaltiesOutput _tanningModifiers>>
<br>
<<pass 60>>
<<if $rng gte 91>>
	<<spa_tan_events>>
<<elseif $rng gte 81>>
	어느새 세션이 끝나고 불이 꺼진다. 깜빡 잠이 들었다.<<ltiredness>><<tiredness -6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Spa]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	세션이 끝나고 불이 꺼질 때까지 긴장을 푼다.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Spa]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
<</if>>

